      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "안녕하십니까, 단장님. 일찍 오셨군요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長。ずいぶん早くいらっしゃいましたね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_08",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "들어가시죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "中に入りましょう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_08",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…자리를 옮겨야 할 것 같다고요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…場所を変えないといけない、ですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_08",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아뇨, 괜찮습니다. 옮기지 않아도 됩니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いえ、大丈夫です。場所を変える必要はありません。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_RECON_AMULET_08",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_RECON_AMULET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "왜냐하면 제가 빌렸으니까요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "貸し切ったのは私ですから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
